力！\n戴爾塔本來覺得比起巧克力，還是肉比較好\n……老大比較喜歡哪個？\n下次再跟戴爾塔一起吃肉吧！","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":100013,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003032,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"來自伊普西龍的一封信","Description":"根據希妲的研究，不管是什麼，\n高音似乎都能更襯托出巧克力的甜味。\n我特地為吾主準備了一首曲子，\n還請務必搭配巧克力一起欣賞。","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":100014,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003033,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"來自潔塔的一封信","Description":"趁你不在的時候，進了一下你的房間。\n明天開始考試對吧？\n有甜的東西，讀書也會比較有效率吧。\n吃了這個後加油吧，掰掰。","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":100015,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003034,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"來自希妲的一封信","Description":"致少主。\n巧克力，給你。裡面什麼都沒加喔。\n因為平常老是給你添麻煩……這是謝禮。\n真的什麼都沒加，所以放心吃吧。","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":100016,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003035,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"迷你相片'23","Description":"那是我第一次遇見努爾時拍下的一張照片呢。\n所有的故事都是從這裡開始的。\n努爾……是不是有點像你呢？","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":90010,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003036,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"迷你相片'24","Description":"為了加深暗房攝影同好會的情誼，我們決定大家一起出去玩。\n還得感謝把希妲硬拉\n出來的戴爾塔呢。","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":90011,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003037,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"迷你相片'25","Description":"新加入的學生會長伽瑪，\n以及微服出行的偶像伊普西龍。\n不管出現什麼樣的邪怪，是我們的話，一定能化險為夷。","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":90012,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003038,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"迷你相片'26","Description":"筆記本不見了，貝塔慌了起來