ame":"後台通行證（蘿絲）","Description":"正式上場前一刻，我因為太緊張而靜不下來，\n就在休息室裡試著揮劍，讓自己集中精神。\n效果非常好，不過亞蕾克西雅小姐卻說這樣讓人靜不下來，\n結果被阻止了……","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003047,"ItemBehaviourType":43,"ItemCategoryTabType":1,"Name":"後台通行證（亞蕾克西雅）","Description":"正式上場前，蘿絲學姊看起來好像有點緊張，\n所以我有去替她打氣。還不都是因為某個\n製作人沒露面嗎？\n……我、我才沒有緊張呢！","IsShowItemInventory":true,"AlternativeIconCode":0,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003048,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援貝塔！Lv.2","Description":"如果可以的話……能為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003040,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003049,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援貝塔！Lv.3","Description":"如果可以的話……能為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003040,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003050,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援貝塔！Lv.MAX","Description":"如果可以的話……能為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003040,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003051,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援潔塔！Lv.2","Description":"你會為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003041,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003052,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援潔塔！Lv.3","Description":"你會為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003041,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0},{"ItemCode":940003053,"ItemBehaviourType":21,"ItemCategoryTabType":0,"Name":"應援潔塔！Lv.MAX","Description":"你會為我應援嗎？","IsShowItemInventory":false,"AlternativeIconCode":940003041,"ShopCode":0,"ShopTransitionText":"","DisplayOrder":0,"VoiceCode":0